        </div>
        <div class="reel-frame">
          <span class="badge badge-gold" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">REEL 03</span>
          <h4>Salary Journey</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--cinema-muted);">A 30-second animated cinema of your year: offer, months, villain (tax), and hero.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="reel-frame">
          <span class="badge badge-teal" style="margin-bottom: 8px;">REEL 04</span>
          <h4>QR Scanner</h4>
          <p style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--cinema-muted);">Cyan scanline viewport delivers instant payment &amp; leave breakdown.</p>
        </div>
