      <div id="pane-tax-detective" class="view-pane">
        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <h2>TAX DETECTIVE // NOIR CASE FILE</h2>
          <p style="color: var(--cinema-muted);">Reveal deduction clues one-by-one to recover lost rupees.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="border: 1px solid var(--cinema-gold);">
          <span class="badge badge-gold" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">CASE #05-NOIR</span>
          <h3 style="color: var(--cinema-cream); margin-bottom: 14px;">TARGET: PRIYA PATEL (EMP-102)</h3>

          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <div class="card" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="revealDetectiveClue(1, this)">
              <strong>🔍 Clue 01: The Regime Mismatch</strong>
              <div class="det-clue-body" style="display: none; font-size: 13px; color: var(--cinema-teal); margin-top: 6px;">
                Enrolled in Old Regime. Switching to New Regime (Budget 2025) saves ₹46,800 immediately!
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="revealDetectiveClue(2, this)">
              <strong>🔍 Clue 02: Unused Section 80C Limit</strong>
              <div class="det-clue-body" style="display: none; font-size: 13px; color: var(--cinema-teal); margin-top: 6px;">
                ₹35,000 remaining in Section 80C. Maxing saves ₹10,920 in tax.
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="revealDetectiveClue(3, this)">
              <strong>🔍 Clue 03: Section 80CCD(1B) NPS</strong>
              <div class="det-clue-body" style="display: none; font-size: 13px; color: var(--cinema-teal); margin-top: 6px;">
                ₹50,000 extra exclusive deduction untouched. Potential savings: ₹15,600!
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="detective-case-closed" style="display: none; background: rgba(244, 201, 93, 0.15); border: 1px solid var(--cinema-gold); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 16px; text-align: center;">
            <h3 style="color: var(--cinema-gold);">CASE CLOSED: YOU COULD SAVE ₹73,320 PER YEAR!</h3>
            <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--cinema-muted);">*Verify with official income-tax rules</span>
