            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">PF (12%): <strong class="font-mono money-val">₹12,000</strong></div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">TDS (Tax): <strong class="font-mono money-val">₹18,500</strong></div>
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 6px;">
