          <div id="onboard-status-badge" style="margin-top: 20px; padding: 12px; background: rgba(16,185,129,0.15); border: 1px solid var(--cinema-emerald); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--cinema-emerald); font-weight: 700; text-align: center;">
            ✓ READY TO PAY: All statutory compliance checks completed!
