                  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">New Regime Tax (Sec 115BAC inc. cess): <strong class="font-mono money-val" style="color: var(--cinema-teal);" id="ca-tax-new-val">₹0</strong></div>
                  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; border-top: 1px solid var(--border-film); margin-top: 8px; padding-top: 8px;">
